# Keep the shipped word list byte-identical across checkouts.
#
# Git's autocrlf rewrites text files to CRLF on Windows, and the dictionary is
# read by splitting on "\n": every word then carried a trailing \r, which made
# `the` fail an equality check and every entry fail a [a-z] test. A clean clone
# on Windows was shipping a dictionary that matched nothing.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
